        },
        {
            "text": "6.0",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "Compliance",
            "style": "H2"
        },
        {
            "text": "6.1",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "Policy review cadence",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "6.1.1 This policy shall be reviewed annually.",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "6.1.2 This policy shall also be reviewed upon significant changes to Inmar’s business,",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "regulatory, and/or technical environment that could impact the content of this",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "document.",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "6.2",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "Compliance measurement",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "6.2.1 The Information Security Governance, Risk, and Compliance team will verify",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "compliance to this policy through various methods, including but not limited to,",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "business tool reports, internal and external audits, and feedback to the author.",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "6.3",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "Sanctions",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "6.3.1 Inmar’s sanction policy applies appropriate sanctions, up to and including",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "termination, against Inmar team members who fail to comply with Inmar’s",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "Information Security Policies and Procedures. Sanctions occur with appropriate",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "involvement of Inmar’s human resources and legal departments.",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "POL#:",
            "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
            "text": "AAA.BBB.CCC.DDD.EE",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "POLICY NAME",
            "style": "H2"
        },
        {
            "text": "Issued Date:",
            "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
            "text": "[Via DocuSign]",
            "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
            "text": "Effective Date:",
            "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
            "text": "[Via DocuSign]",
            "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
            "text": "Confidential",
            "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
            "text": "4 of 5",
            "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
            "text": "6.3.2 Inmar team members must comply with all applicable Information Security Policies",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "and Procedures in order to ensure the confidentiality, integrity, and availability of",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "data in its information systems.",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "6.3.3 Inmar provides annual security awareness training to team members on their",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "Information Security Policies and Procedures.",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "6.3.4 Inmar prefers that team members self-report any inadvertent violations of Inmar’s",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "Policies and Procedures. A self-report will result in counseling by the Privacy",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "Officer or its legal parent’s human resources or legal department. Repeated",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "inadvertent violations may result in disciplinary action up to and including",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "termination.",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "7.0",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "Exceptions",
            "style": "H2"
        },
        {
            "text": "7.1",
            "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
            "text": "Any exception to the policy must be approved by the Chief Information Security Officer",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "(CISO) or designee in advance.",
            "style": "H3"
        },
